/P 329 0 R
/E (Project Star is a comprehensive, full-stack Educational Institution Management System designed to digitize and streamline academic operations for schools, coaching centers, and training institutes. It integrates student learning, teacher instruction, parent monitoring, and administrative functions into a unified ecosystem accessible via web platforms.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
