157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 337 0 R
/E (Performance & Security: The application delivers fast response times \(< 500ms for API calls, < 2 seconds for page loads\) using optimized React 18 with Vite bundling and efficient MongoDB queries. Security is enforced through JWT-based stateless authentication, password encryption, CORS policies, role-based access control on all API endpoints, and secure file upload validation. Environment variables protect sensitive credentials, and a pre-push validation script prevents accidental exposure of secrets to GitHub.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 338 0 R
/E (Scalability & Reliability: Built on a cloud-hosted MongoDB Atlas database and stateless Spring Boot 3.4.0 backend, the architecture supports horizontal scaling for unlimited users and batches. The system maintains 99%+ uptime with automatic backups, comprehensive error handling with user-friendly messages, data validation before all operations, and graceful degradation during failures. Cross-browser compatibility \(Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge\) and responsive design ensure accessibility across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices, while modular code architecture with separation of concerns enables easy maintenance and feature additions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
